config ICM42688P_I2C
	tristate "HuaXuanYang ICM-42688P I2C driver"
	depends on I2C
	select REGMAP_I2C
	help
	  Driver for the HuaXuanYang ICM-42688P 6-axis IMU over I2C.
	  Register map follows ICM_42688P-HXY.pdf (not InvenSense ICM-426xx).

	  To compile as a module, choose M here. The module is icm42688p.
